t_representativeness":0.9239129424095154,"text_excerpt":"At the St Roch market. Went last week (Oct ,2015) . I had a \"to die for\" shaved Brussels sprouts salad, and a very tasty pastrami sandwich (just a tad on the greasy side). Good service, decent price. I intend to return."},{"business_id":"ZdvKfuS_x7lmtmeCO46Mmg","review_id":"GVAICwTkSG11DEj-2546sw","date":"2015-05-07T16:18:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9190149307250977,"text_excerpt":"Pork Belly Sandwich was fantastic. Fast, friendly and great ingredients. Solid addition to the new St. Roch Market."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
